{"unit_id":"lonelymoon87__dsh-gitflow#feature-1","repo":"lonelymoon87/dsh-gitflow","commit":"60f254e2af0ff09f55d602953e5bad7b3b637a95","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-gitflow 的功能「工作区状态」：读取当前分支及干净、暂存、未暂存和未跟踪文件计数，并附上 Git 状态摘要。通过 git_status 工具触发，输入为当前 agent 工作区。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:339-363"]}
